namaḥ dakṣakurpare (4)ṃklīṃnamaḥ nābhau (4)ṃsauṃḥnamaḥ vāmajānuni (4)ṃ
aiṃnamaḥ dakṣajānuni (4)ṃklīṃnamaḥ liṃge (4)ṃsauṃḥnamaḥ vāmapāde (4)ṃaiṃ
namaḥ dakṣapāde (4)ṃklīṃnamaḥ guhye (4)ṃsauṃḥnamaḥ vāmapārśve (4)ṃaiṃ
namaḥ dakṣapārśve (4)ṃklīṃnamaḥ hṛdi (4)ṃsauṃnamaḥ vāmastane (4)ṃaiṃnamaḥ 
dakṣastane (4)ṃklīṃnamaḥ kaṃṭhe (4)ṃsauṃnamaḥ itinavayoninyāsaḥ atha
aṃtarnavayoninyāsaḥ tatomūlādhārādiṣaṭcakralalāṭasīmaṃta

<pṛ0 226ba> vrahmaraṃdhreṣunavasusthāneṣucaturasraveṣṭitanavayonīḥparika
lpya tāsuagrādiprāgdakṣiṇyakrameṇaprāduktavījatrayaṃmanasā
dhyāyannyaset itiaṃtarnavayoninyāsaḥ athaśrṛṃkhalādinyāsaḥ 
śikhāyāṃ (4)ṃprathamakūṭaṃnamaḥ civuke (4)ṃdvitīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ mukhe (4)ṃ
tṛtīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ (1) mūkhe (4)ṃprathamakūṭaṃnamaḥ kaṃṭhe (4)ṃdvitīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ 
civuke (4)ṃtṛtīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ (2) civuke (4)ṃprathamakūṭaṃnamaḥ hṛdaye (4)ṃdvi
tīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ kaṃṭhe (4)ṃtṛtīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ (3) kaṃṭhe (4)ṃprathamakūṭaṃnamaḥ nā

<pṛ0 227a> bhau (4)ṃdvitīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ hṛdaye (4)ṃtṛtīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ (4) hṛdaye (4)ṃpra
thamakūṭaṃnamaḥ svādhiṣṭhāne (4)ṃdvitīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ nābhau (4)ṃtṛtīya(-)
kūṭaṃnamaḥ (5) nābhau (4)ṃprathamakūṭaṃnamaḥ mūlādhāre (4)ṃdvitīyakūṭaṃna
maḥ svādhiṣṭhāne (4)ṃtṛtīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ (6) svādhiṣṭhāne (4)ṃprathamakūṭaṃ
namaḥ ūrvo (4)ṃdvitīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ mūlādhāre (4)ṃtṛtīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ (7) 
mūlādhāre (4)ṃprathamakūṭaṃnamaḥ jānvoḥ (4)ṃdvitīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ ūrvoḥ 
(4)ṃtṛtīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ (8) ūrvoḥ (4)ṃprathamakūṭaṃnamaḥ pādayoḥ (4)ṃdvitīya

<pṛ0 227ba> kūṭaṃnamaḥ jānvoḥ (4)ṃtṛtīyakūṭaṃnamaḥ itiśrṛṃkhalādinyāsaḥ 
athaamaṭhanyāsaḥ śirasi oṃsarasvatyainamaḥ lalāṭe hrīṃpā
rvatyainamaḥ dakṣanetre aṃsavitrenamaḥ vāme maṃagnayenamaḥ mukhavṛtte 
ṭhaṃcaṃdramasenamaḥ jihvāyāṃ śrīṃśriyenamaḥ dakṣakapole svāṃdaṃtine
namaḥ vāme hāṃdaṃtinenamaḥ itiamaṭhanyāsaḥ itthaṃnyāsānvidhāya
praṇavasaṃpuṭitāṃ śrīṣoḍaśāṃrṇāṃsarvāṃgevyāpakatvenavinyasya punaḥ
praṇavasaṃpuṭitāṃśrīṣoḍaśārṇāṃstathāvidhāṃtāṃhṛdayenyaset atha

<pṛ0 228a> ṛṣyādikaraṣaḍaṃganyāsaṃvidhāya śivohamitibhāvayan vakṣya
māṇasaṃkṣobhiṇyādinavamudrāḥpāśādicaturmudrāścavaddhvā sarvā
vayavabhāvenakāmakalārūpaṃsvātmānaṃdhyātvā śaktyutthāpanamudrāṃ
vaddhvā prātaḥsmaraṇoktaprakāreṇamūlādhārātkuṃḍalinīmutthāpya 
tathaivaṣaṭcakrapūjāṃvidhāya tattejasāṃpariṇatāṃśrīparadevatāṃhṛ
dayakamalagatasiṃhāsaneśrīcakrarājekāmeśvarāṃkasthāṃ sarvābhara
ṇasaṃyuktāṃtrikhaṃḍāmudritakarodhyāyedyathā oṃtaruṇollāsasaṃyuktāṃ

<pṛ0 228ba> suprasannaḥsvātmānamevatadabhedākāratayāprauḍhoṃtollāsavā
n oṃudyaccaṃdrodayakṣuvdharaktapīyūṣavāridheḥ madhyehemamayīṃbhūmiṃ
smaretmāṇikyamaṃḍitāṃ tanmadhyenaṃdanodyānaṃmadanonmādanaṃmahat 
nityābhyuditapūrṇeṃdujyotsnājālavirājitaṃ kadaṃvacūtapunnāga
nāgakesaracaṃpakaiḥ vakulaiḥpārijātaiścasarvartukusumojjvalaiḥ 
huṃkāramukharairbhṛṃgaiḥkūjadbhiḥkokilaiḥśukaiḥ nānāvarṇairathānyaiścadvi
jasaṃghairniṣevitaṃ śikhikāraṃḍahaṃsādyaiḥnānāpakṣibhirāvṛtaṃ nānāpu

<pṛ0 229a> ṣpalatākīrṇaiḥśobhitaṃvṛkṣakhaṃḍakaiḥ paryaṃtadīrghikotphullakama
lolpalasaṃbhavaiḥ rajobhirdhūsaraṃsamyaksevitaṃmalayānilaiḥ dhyātvai
vaṃnaṃdanodyānaṃtadaṃtaḥprāṃganaṃsmaret śuddhakāṃcanasaṃkāśavasudhābhi
ralaṃkṛtaṃ prāṃganaṃciṃtayitvetthaṃsurasiddhaniṣevitaṃ tanmadhyemaṃḍapaṃ
dhyāyedvyāptavrahmāṃḍamaṃḍalaṃ sahasrādityasaṃkāśaṃcaturaśraṃsuśo
bhitaṃ ratnatejaḥprabhāpuṃjapiṃjarīkṛtadiṅmukhaṃ madhyastaṃbhavinirmu
ktaṃkoṇastaṃbhasamanvitaṃ mahāmāṇikyavaiḍūryaratnakāṃcanabhūṣitaṃ 

<pṛ0 229ba> muktādāmavitānāḍhyaṃratnasopānabhūṣitaṃ maṃdavāyusamākrāṃtaṃ
gaṃdhadhūpataraṃgitaṃ ratnacāmaraghaṃṭādivimānairupaśobhitaṃ jātī
caṃpakapunnāgaketakīmallikādibhiḥ raktotpalasitāṃbhojamā(-)
dhavībhiḥsupuṣpakaiḥ vaddhābhiścitramālābhiḥsarvartumamalaṃkṛtaṃ 
tiryagūrdhvalasadratnaputtalīkoṭimaṃḍitaṃ nānāratnadibhirdivyairni
rmitaṃviśvakarmaṇā tanmadhyevipulāṃdhyāyedvedikāṃśatayojanāṃ sa
hasrādityasaṃkāśāṃkoṭimāṇikyamaṃḍitāṃ caturdvārasamepetāṃmā(-)

<pṛ0 230a> ṇikyadvāratoraṇāṃ pradīpaiḥpūrṇakuṃbhaiścasarvataḥsamalaṃkṛtaṃ patā
kābhiścahaimībhiḥsāṃkurābhiralaṃkṛtāṃ ratnapīṭhasthitairdivyairāga
maiḥpariśobhitāṃ tadaṃtarāṃtarāprodyanmaṇidarpaṇasaṃkulāṃ madhurodā
ravividhagaṃdharvastotravṛṃhitāṃ śrṛṃgārarasasannaddhairnavayauvanaśobhitaiḥ 
amarīnikarairnānāmaṇibhūṣaṇabhūṣitaiḥ vīṇāveṇumṛdaṃgādivādane
nacanṛttakaiḥ prīṇayadbhirmahādevīṃparitāṃparitaḥsadā ratnasiṃhāsanaṃ
tasyāvedyāmadhyesmarecchubhaṃ viriṃcirudraviṣṇvīśaśivapādacatuṣṭayaṃ 

<pṛ0 230ba> sadāśivamayaṃsākṣāttasminparaśivātmakaṃ puṣpaparyaṃkamaiśvaryaṃtatra
śrīcakranāmakaṃ tanmadhyeyonimadhyastheśrīmaduḍḍyānapīṭhake paryaṃka
vaṃdhavilasatsvastikāsanalālitāṃ dhyāyetparaśivāṃkasthāṃpadmamadhyo
jvalākṛtiṃ tatodhyānaṃpravakṣyāmitridaśaiḥsevanīyakaṃ tataḥpadmani
bhāṃdevīṃvālārkakiraṇāruṇāṃ japākusumasaṃkāśāṃdāḍimīkusumopa
māṃ padmarāgapratīkāśāṃkuṃkumodakasannibhāṃ sphuranmukuṭamāṇikya(-)
kiṃkiṇījālamaṃḍitāṃ kālālikulasaṃkāśakuṭilālakapallavāṃ 

<pṛ0 231a> pratyagrāruṇasaṃkāśavadanāṃbhojamaṃḍalāṃ kiṃcidardheṃdukuṭilalalāṭa
mṛdupaṭṭikāṃ pinākadhanurākārabhrūlatāṃparameśvarīṃ ānaṃdamuditollo
lalīlāndolitalocanāṃ sphuranmayūkhasaṃghātavilasaddhemakuṃḍalāṃ su
gaṃḍamaṃḍalābhogajitendumṛtamaṃḍalāṃ viśvakarmādinirmāṇasūtrasuspaṣṭa
nāsikāṃ raktavidrumaviṃvābharaktoṣṭīmamṛtopamāṃ dāḍimīvījavajrābha
daṃtapaṃktivirājitāṃ ratnadvīpasphūradratnajihvāmamalabhāṣiṇīṃ smita
mādhuryavijitamādhuryarasasāgarāt anaupamyaguṇopetacivukoddeśa

<pṛ0 231ba> śobhitāṃ kaṃvugrīvāṃmahādevīṃmṛṇālalalitairbhujaiḥ maṇikaṃkaṇake
yūrabhārakhinnaiḥpraśobhitāṃ raktotpaladalākārasukumārakarāṃvujāṃ 
karāṃvujanakhajyotirvirājitanabhasthalīṃ muktāhāralatopetasamunna
tapayodharāṃ trivalīvalanāyuktamadhyadeśasuśobhitāṃ lāvaṇyasaridā
vartākāranābhivibhūṣitāṃ anargharatnaghaṭitakāṃcīyuktanitaṃvinīṃ 
nitaṃvaviṃvadviradaromarājīvaśāṃkurāṃ kadalīlalitastaṃbhasukumāro
rumīśvarīṃ lāvaṇyakusumākārajānumaṃjulavaṃdhurāṃ lāvaṇyakaṃdalītu

<pṛ0 232a> lyajaṃghāyugalamaṃḍitāṃ gūḍhagulphapadadvaṃdvaprapadājitakachapāṃ tanu
dīrghāṃgulībhāsvannakhacaṃdravirājitāṃ vrahmaviṣṇuśiroratnanirghṛṣṭacara
ṇāṃvujāṃ śītāṃśuśatasaṃkāśakāṃtisaṃtānahāsinīṃ lauhityajita
siṃdūrajapādāḍimarāgiṇīṃ raktavastraparīdhānāṃpāśāṃkuśakarodyatāṃ 
raktapadyaniviṣṭāṃcaraktābharaṇabhūṣitāṃ caturbhujāṃtrinetrāṃcapaṃcavāṇa
dhanurdharāṃ karpūraśakalonmiśratāṃvūlāpūritānanāṃ mahāmṛgamado(-)
ddāmakuṃkumāruṇavigrahāṃ sarvaśrṛṃgāraveśāḍhyāṃsarvālaṃkārabhūṣitāṃ 

<pṛ0 232ba> jagadāhlādajananīṃjagadraṃjanakāriṇīṃ jagadākarṣaṇakarīṃjaga
tkāraṇarūpiṇīṃ sarvamaṃtramayīṃdevīṃsarvasaubhāgyasuṃdarīṃ sarvalakṣmī
mayīṃnityāṃparamānaṃdasuṃdarīṃ evaṃdhyāyenmaheśānīṃmahātripurasuṃ
darī itisvaikyenadhyātvā mūlavidyayāsvaśirasipuṣpāṃjaliṃdatvā 
punarhṛdayakamaleyathoktarūpāṃsāṃgāsāvaraṇāṃdhyātvā vakṣyamāṇapra
kāreṇapīṭhapūjādipūrvakaṃsāṃgāsāvaraṇāṃmānasairupacāraiḥsaṃpūjya 
naivedyaṃdatvā bhojanāvasurāṃtervaiśvadevaṃkuryāt tatramūlādhāreātmā

<pṛ0 233a> tarātmajñānātmaparamātmasvarūpaṃcaturaśraṃkuṃḍaṃkuṃḍalyagnisamu(-)
jjvalaṃ ānaṃdamekhalāyuktaṃvibhāvya tanmadhyecidānaṃdajñānāgnau
jahuyādyathā oṃaiṃhrīṃśrīṃmūlaṃahaṃtāṃjuhomisvāhā mūlaṃasa
tyaṃjuhomisvāhā mūlaṃpaiśunyaṃjuhomisvāhā mūlaṃkāmaṃjuhomi
svāhā mūlaṃkrodhaṃjuhomisvāhā mūlaṃlobhaṃjuhomisvāhā mūlaṃ
mohaṃjuhomisvāhā mūlaṃmadaṃjuhomisvāhā mūlaṃmātsaryaṃjuho(-)
misvāhā itihutvāpūrṇāhutitrayaṃdadyādyathā mūlenamūlāgnaunābhi

<pṛ0 233ba> caitanyahaviṣāmanasāsrucā jñānapradīpitenityamakṣavṛttīrju
homyahaṃsvāhā anenaprathāmāhutiṃdadyāt (1) mūlaṃ dharmādharma(-)
harvidīpteātmāgnaumanasāsrucā suṣumṇāvartmanānityamakṣa
vṛttīrjuhomyahaṃ svāhā anenadvitīyāhutiṃdadyāt (2) mūlaṃ prakā
śākāśahastābhyāmavalaṃbhyonmanīsrucaṃ dharmādharmakalāsnehapūrṇāṃ
vahnaujuhomyahaṃ svāhā anenatṛtīyāhutiṃdadyāt (3) aṃtarniraṃtarani(-)
riṃdhanamedhamānemāyāṃdhakāraparipaṃthinisaṃvidagdhau kasyāṃcida(-)

<pṛ0 234a> dbhutamarīcivikāsabhūmauviśvaṃjuhomivasudhādiśivāvasā
naṃsvāhā itipūrṇāhutitrayaṃdatvā svātmānamevacidānaṃdaghanaṃ
dhyāyan pūrṇohamadvitīyohaṃśivohaṃsādhakopyahaṃ paraṃvrahmā
nusaṃdhānakāmanāyuktamānasaḥ prauḍhoṃtollāsavāṃścāhaṃvidhū
tāśeṣakalmaṣaḥ cidānaṃdarasāpūrṇāstripurībhūtacidvapuḥ dai
śikaśuklaraktāvjamīlatodyuktamānasaḥ prāṇāpānatroṭanecchā
pūritākhilaviśvasūḥ evaṃsādhakasadbhāvaṃvibhāvyārcanamārabhet 

<pṛ0 234ba> punaḥhṛdayakamaledevīṃdhyātvā uttarāpośānādisarvopacārairā
rādhyā mūlaṃyathāśaktijapitvā prāṇāyāmādinājapaṃsamarpya śrī
guruṃpraṇamya svadehaṃgaṃdhādibhiralaṃkṛtya kuṃkumāgurukastūrī(-)
karpūraṃcaṃdanaṃtathā anenagaṃdhadeveśimaṃḍalaṃkārayettataḥ kala
śasthāpanaṃkuryāt tatrasvavāmabhāgeṣaṭkoṇāṃtargatatrikoṇa(-)
dvayaviṃduvāhyavṛttacaturaśraṃkṛtvā svadakṣetrikoṇaṃvṛttiviṃvamaṃḍa
laṃbhūmauviracayya aiṃkeilahrīṃnamaḥ agne klīṃhasakahalahrīṃna

<pṛ0 235a> maḥ dakṣe sauṃḥsakalahrīṃnamaḥ vāme hrīṃtatrādhāraśaktyainamaḥ madhye i
tisaṃpūjya tatraśrīṃhrīṃklīṃaiṃsauṃḥhṛdayāyanamaḥ oṃaiṃhrīṃśrīṃśira(-)
sesvāhā keīlahrīṃśikhāyaivauṣaṭ hasakahalahrīṃkavacāyahuṃ 
sakalahrīṃnetratrayāyavaṣaṭ sauṃḥaiṃklīṃhrīṃśrīṃastrāyaphaṭ iti
ṣaṭkoṇaṃṣaḍaṃgenasaṃpūjya tatrādhāraṃnikṣipya tadupariastrāya
phaḍitiśodhitaṃ namaḥitimaṃtreṇapūritaṃpātraṃśaṃkhādikaṃvāsaṃsthā
pya gaṃdhākṣatapuṣpayavakuśāgratilasarṣapadūrvāitisāmānyārghya(-)

<pṛ0 235ba> pātradravyāni tatra oṃgaṃgecayamuceti ityaṃkuśamudrayātīrthamā
vāhya gaṃdhākṣatapuṣpādikaṃsāmānyārghyapātrepraṇaveṇanikṣipya 
vahnisūryasomakalābhiḥsaṃpūjya dhenumudrāṃpradarśya ātmāṣṭā
kṣaramaṃtreṇatyarthaḥ oṃhrīṃhaṃsaḥsohaṃsvāhā svamaṃtreṇacasaṃpūjaye
t itividhivihitasāmānyārghyodakenasvavāmekṛtamaṃḍala
mabhyukṣya tatrādhāraśaktayenamaḥ madhye tadupare kālāgnirudrāya
namaḥ maṃḍūkāyanamaḥ kūrmāyanamaḥ anaṃtāyanamaḥ mūlaprakṛtyai

<pṛ0 236a> namaḥ pṛthivyainamaḥ sudhāṃvudhayenamaḥ sudhāsamudrāyanamaḥ 
ikṣusamu्drāyanamaḥ madirāsamudrāyanamaḥ kṣīrasamudrāyanamaḥ 
dadhisamudrāyanamaḥ ghṛtasamudrāyanamaḥ kṣārasamudrāyanamaḥ 
maṇidvīpāyanamaḥ ciṃtāmaṇigṛhāyanamaḥ navakhaṃḍavirājita
ratnavedikāyainamaḥ ciṃtāmaṇipīṭhāyanamaḥ ratnasiṃhāsanā(-)
yanamaḥ sahasrārapadmāyanamaḥ padmarāgaratnāyanamaḥ suvarṇagi
rayenamaḥ naṃdanodyānāyanamaḥ nānāmaṇigaṇebhyonamaḥ nānā(-)

<pṛ0 236ba> devebhyonamaḥ dharmāyanamaḥ jñānāyanamaḥ vairāgyāyanamaḥ ai
śvaryāyanamaḥ adharmāyanamaḥ ajñānāyanamaḥ avairāgyāyana
maḥ anaiśvaryāyanamaḥ śeṣāyanamaḥ padmāyanamaḥ prakṛtima
yapatrebhyonamaḥ vikāramayakesarebhyonamaḥ paṃcāśadvījabhū
ṣitakarṇikāyainamaḥ sūryamaṃḍalāyanamaḥ somamaṃḍalāyanamaḥ 
vaiśvānaramaṃḍalāyanamaḥ saṃsattvāyanamaḥ raṃrajasenamaḥ taṃtama
senamaḥ taṃtamasenamaḥ āṃātmanenamaḥ aṃaṃtarātmanenamaḥ 

<pṛ0 237a> paṃparamātmanenamaḥ hrīṃjñānātmanenamaḥ vāmāyainamaḥ jyeṣṭāyai
namaḥ raudryainamaḥ aṃvikāyainamaḥ icchāyainamaḥ jñānāyainamaḥ 
kriyāyainamaḥ kuvjikāyainamaḥ citrāyainamaḥ viṣaghnikāyaina
maḥ dūtaryainamaḥ ānaṃdāyainamaḥ manonmanyainamaḥ aiṃparāyainamaḥ 
aiṃaparāyainamaḥ aieṃvirūpāyainamaḥ hsauṃḥsadāśivamahāpretapadmā
sanāyanamaḥ itimaṃḍalaṃsaṃpūjya namitiprakṣālya tatrādhāraṃsaṃsthā(-)
pya oṃāṃhrīṃkrauṃyaṃdhūmrādidharmapradadaśakalānāṃprāṇāihaprāṇāḥ

<pṛ0 237ba> jīvihasthitaḥsarveṃdriyāṇīhasthitāni vāṅmanaḥśrotraprāṇā
ihāgatyasukhaṃtiṣṭaṃtusvāhā itilelihānumudrayāprāṇānsaṃsthā
pyāvāhayet yaṃdhūmrādidharmapradāgnikalāihāgacchata (2) saṃtiṣṭhata (2) 
sannidhata (2) sannidadhata (2) pūjāṃgṛhṇata (2) ityāvāhanaṃkṛtvāpūjaye
t oṃrāṃrīṃrūṃramalavarūṃvahnimaṃḍalāyadharmapradadaśakalātmaneaiṃ
kalaśādhārāyanamaḥ yaṃdhūmrāyainamaḥ raṃnīlavarṇāyainamaḥ laṃka(-)
pilāyainamaḥ vaṃvisphuliṃginyainamaḥ śaṃjvālāyainamaḥ ṣaṃhaimavatyai

